>> title: Buttermilk Pancakes
>> category: Flatbreads & Pancakes
>> tags: breakfast, buttermilk, griddle, batter
>> counters: Diner
>> aka: short stack, hotcakes, flapjacks, griddle cakes
>> servings: 4
>> time: 30 min

Whisk @all-purpose flour{2%cup}(260 g), @sugar{2%Tbsp}(25 g), @baking powder{2%tsp}(8 g), @baking soda{1/2%tsp}(3 g), and @fine sea salt{3/4%tsp}(4 g).

Beat @buttermilk{2%cup}(480 mL), @eggs{2%large}(100 g), and @melted unsalted butter{4%Tbsp}(55 g).

Stir @&(~2)dry mixture{}, @&(~1)wet mixture{} together just until lumpy.

Rest @&(~1)batter{} ~{10%min}.

>> step: cook on a buttered griddle at 375°F, 2 min per side
Ladle @&(~1)batter{} onto a #griddle{} greased with @butter for the griddle{1%Tbsp}(14 g) and cook at 375°F ~{2%min} per side.
